{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_011min_2_1_8_011_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:932cc9780790b1beca93977fb1add93b1bf97a72fc2b326e2280526e1387e97b",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_011min_2_1_8_011_02:1_8_011_02:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ee585c0dbd2da1227b1a71b8a4ccd9bb1f85091aaf545f9e773464e4e97fb62",
      "text": "辛苦了！好，在去换衣服之前\n……啊，在这呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_011min_2_1_8_011_02:1_8_011_02:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:084af34eebd0ac5cd722f986d31d171202d33bc40e66e63ff85fc329a458a052",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，祝你生日快乐！\n今天一定要度过美好的一天哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_011min_2_1_8_011_02:1_8_011_02:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2dfc122078990544342f850d26c309738ba93a1843099456f669ab9856612395",
      "text": "非常感谢！穿着这身服装对我说这句话，\n感觉今天真的会变得无比美妙呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_011min_2_1_8_011_02:1_8_011_02:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6c3e642e5400bd9dbe2c96aa031d76c638a931edd165a8f00bef7b74815be0a4",
      "text": "是吗？那太好了。难得的机会，\n我想在换衣服前跟你说一句嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_011min_2_1_8_011_02:1_8_011_02:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e515017740af3d4be5162044c7f8994af3b85eeff762d4636b52caa784fd49d3",
      "text": "再次祝你生日快乐，今后也请多关照啦。我一直指望着你哦，\n●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
